e Km\/hora, distancia recorrida, duraci\u00f3n de bater\u00eda y muchas m\u00e1s funciones.<\/LI><LI>LUCES: Foco de LED delantero y luz de freno trasera para m\u00e1xima visibilidad.<\/LI><LI>ENCENDIDO: CON LLAVE DE CONTACTO (On Off), mucho m\u00e1s seguro<\/LI><LI>APAGADO: Smart Energy Saving (Apagado Autom\u00e1tico)<\/LI><LI>PESO PERMITIDO: M\u00e1ximo peso permitido de hasta 120 kgs<\/LI><LI>DIMENSIONES: <BR><\/LI><UL><LI>Desplegado: 113X119X59 <BR><\/LI><LI>Plegado: 113X54,5X59<\/LI><\/UL><LI>PESO DEL PAT\u00cdN: 26 Kg<\/LI><LI>PESO DEL ASIENTO: 2 Kg<\/LI><LI>Incluye: Cargador y manual de instrucciones<\/LI><LI>Otros: Incluye: SmartGyro e-Xplorer, cargador y manual de instrucciones. Asiento incluido dentro de la caja. Protecci\u00f3n al agua y al polvo. Cero emisiones, respetuoso con el medio ambiente.<\/LI><\/UL>                                                                                        ","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"SMARTGYRO","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":18,"unit_price":719.3,"unit_price_tax":719.3,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Patinetes - Hoverboards","sub_category":"Patinetes Electricos","quantity":2,"brand":"SMARTGYRO","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_wox-patin%20sg27-178_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":714.3}}},"8435602905200":{"result":false,"need_alert":false,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["8435602905200",false],"wholesale_price":[143.73,false],"price":[148.73,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["",false],"weight":["",false],"images":["",false],"tags":["",false],"features":["",false],"combinations":["",false]},"need_alert":false,"errors":["A propriedade Product->name n\u00e3o \