 de confianza (firmware TPM)<\/li>  <li><b>Memoria<\/b>: RAM DDR4-3200 MHz 8 GB (2 x 4 GB)<\/li>  <li>Dise\u00f1o de la memoria (ranuras y tama\u00f1o): 2 x 4 GB<\/li>  <li><b>Almacenamiento interno:<\/b> SSD PCIe\u00ae NVMe&#8482; TLC M.2 de 512 GB<\/li>  <li>Unidad \u00f3ptica: Unidad \u00f3ptica no incluida<\/li>  <li><b>Pantalla<\/b>: FHD de 16,1' (40,9 cm) en diagonal, IPS, bisel micro-edge, antirreflectante, 250 nits, 45 % NTSC (1920 x 1080)<\/li>  <li>Tama\u00f1o de la pantalla (diagonal): 16,1' (40,9 cm)<\/li><li><b>Gr\u00e1ficos<\/b>:&nbsp;GPU de port\u00e1til NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GTX 1650 (GDDR6 de 4 GB dedicada)<br><\/li>  <li><b>Puertos<\/b>:&nbsp;<\/li><ul><li>1 SuperSpeed USB Type-C\u00ae con velocidad de se\u00f1al de 5 Gbps (DisplayPort&#8482; 1.4, HP Sleep and Charge)<\/li><li>1 SuperSpeed USB Type-A con velocidad de se\u00f1al de 5 Gbps (HP Sleep and Charge)<\/li><li>2 SuperSpeed USB Type-A con velocidad de se\u00f1al de 5 Gbps<\/li><li>1 HDMI 2.0<\/li><li>1 RJ-45<\/li><li>1 pin inteligente de CA; 1 combo de auriculares\/micr\u00f3fono<\/li><\/ul>  <li>Ranuras de expansi\u00f3n: Lector de tarjetas SD multiformato HP<\/li>  <li><b>Webcam<\/b>: C\u00e1mara HP Wide Vision 720p HD con micr\u00f3fonos digitales de matriz dual integrados<\/li>  <li>Sonido: Audio de B&amp;O; Altavoces duales; HP Audio Boost<\/li>  <li>Dispositivo se\u00f1alador: HP Imagepad compatible con funci\u00f3n gestual multit\u00e1ctil; Compatibilidad con Precision Touchpad<\/li>  <li><b>Teclado<\/b>: Teclado de tama\u00f1o completo, con retroiluminaci\u00f3n, de color blanco cer\u00e1mico y teclado num\u00e9rico<\/li>  <li>Dispositivos de entrada: Aceler\u00f3metro<\/li>  <li><b>Inal\u00e1mbrico<\/b>: Tarjeta inal\u00e1mbrica Realtek Wi-Fi 6 (2x2) y Bluetooth\u00ae 5.2 (soporta velocidad de datos Gigabit)<\/li>  <li>Tipo de fuente de alimentaci\u00f3n: Adaptador de alimentaci\u00f3n Smart AC de 150 W<\/li>  <li><b>Tipo de bater\u00eda:<\/b> Pol\u00edmero de ion-litio 4 celdas, 70 Wh<\/li>  <li>Dise\u00f1o de productos: Acabado con pintura<\/li>  <li><b>Color del producto<\/b>: Blanco cer\u00e1mico, logotipo cromado negro<\/li>  <li><b>Dimensiones m\u00ednimas (ancho x fondo x alto):<\/b> 37 x 26 x 2,35 cm (Las dimensiones var\u00edan seg\u00fan la configuraci\u00f3n)<\/li>  <li><b>Peso<\/b>: 2,46 kg<\/li><\/ul><br><p><\/p><p><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"HP","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":3.43,"unit_price":543.18,"unit_price_tax":543.18,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Portatiles","sub_category":"Portatiles Gaming","quantity":5,"brand":"HP","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_hpp-victus%2016-e0080ns_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":538.18}}},"0196548973774":{"result":false,"need_alert":false,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["0196548973774",false],"wholesale_price":[641.32,false],"price":[646.32,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["",false],"weight":["",false],"images":["",false],"tags":["",false],"features":["",false],"combinations":["",false]},"need_alert":false,"errors":["A propriedade Product->name n\u00e3o \u00e9 v\u00e1lida Name: Laptop para jogos HP VICTUS 16-E1001NS Ryzen 5 6600H\/ 16 GB\/ 512 GB SSD\/ GeForce RTX 3050\/ 16,1&#39;\/ Sem sistema operacional"],"result":false},"feed_data":{"name_pt":"Port\u00e1til Gaming HP VICTUS 16-E1001NS Ryzen 5 6600H\/ 16GB\/ 512GB SSD\/ GeForce RTX 3050\/ 16.1'\/ Sin Sistema Operativo","category":"Portatiles","sub_category":"Portatiles Gaming","unit_price":646.32,"reference":"6H6M1EA","ean13":"0196548973774","weight":"3.58","quantity":5,"brand":"HP","description_pt":"<p><h2>Hora de jugar<\/h2><p>Con la tecnolog\u00eda de un procesador