ECNOLOG\u00cdA&nbsp;<\/b><\/li><li>Sensor \u00f3ptico<\/li><li><b>SWITCHES<\/b><\/li><li>Mec\u00e1nicos HUANO&nbsp;<\/li><li><b>DPI&nbsp;<\/b><\/li><li>800\/1200\/1600\/3200<\/li><li><b>BOTONES<\/b><\/li><li>6<\/li><li><b>DISE\u00d1O<\/b><\/li><li>Ergon\u00f3mico<\/li><li><b>COMPATIBLE<\/b><\/li><li>Windows, Linux, Mac, PS4, PS5, XBOXONE, XBOX SERIES X-S<\/li><li><b>CABLE<\/b><\/li><li>1.6m<\/li><li><b>CORRIENTE<\/b><\/li><li>16.5mA&nbsp;<\/li><li><b>VOLTAJE<\/b><\/li><li>DC 5V&nbsp;<\/li><li><b>DIMENSIONES<\/b><\/li><li>116x62x38mm<\/li><\/ul><\/p>","images":"https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_tac-mou%20amg_1.jpg","wholesale_price":"3.18","unit_price_tax":8.18},"product_model":{"product_data":{"ean13":["8437023608142"],"reference":"AMG","name":{"1":"Rat\u00f3n Anima AMG\/ Hasta 3200 DPI","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description":{"1":"<p><\/p><h2>Rat\u00f3n profesional AMG<\/h2><p>M\u00e1xima ergonom\u00eda ultraligera, precisi\u00f3n y durabilidad. Con un sensor \u00f3ptico de 3200 DPI seleccionables en 4 niveles, una forma ergon\u00f3mica natural y switches profesionales HUANO, este rat\u00f3n garantiza la herramienta perfecta con la que enfrentarte a cualquier necesidad.<\/p><p><\/p><ul><li>Sensor \u00f3ptico Profesional 3200 DPI<\/li><li>Forma ergon\u00f3mica natural ultraligera<\/li><li>Switches mec\u00e1nicos HUANO<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h2>Todo el control en la palma de tu mano<\/h2><p>El dise\u00f1o del AMG es peque\u00f1o, compacto y ligero, garantizando una movilidad incre\u00edble y una velocidad ideal para afrontar cualquier uso, tanto profesional como gaming, sin esfuerzo.<\/p><h2>Precisi\u00f3n total<\/h2><p>El sensor \u00f3ptico de 3200 DPI del AMG proporciona una absoluta precisi\u00f3n en usos profesionales y gaming, haciendo que cada movimiento sea totalmente fluido y permiti\u00e9ndote cambiar entre 800 \/ 1200 \/ 1600 \/ 3200 DPI con su bot\u00f3n de cambio on-the-fly. Adem\u00e1s, el dise\u00f1o ligero y el acabado del AMG se combinan para facilitar un agarre firme.<\/p><h2>Switches mec\u00e1nicos HUANO<\/h2><p>El rat\u00f3n AMG cuenta con switches mec\u00e1nicos HUANO para conseguir dos prestaciones vitales: precisi\u00f3n y durabilidad. Ofrecen una vida \u00fatil extendida a la vez que agilizan la pulsaci\u00f3n, logrando que tus acciones sean precisas en todo momento.<\/p><br><p><\/p><p><ul><li><b>TECNOLOG\u00cdA&nbsp;<\/b><\/li><li>Sensor \u00f3ptico<\/li><li><b>SWITCHES<\/b><\/li><li>Mec\u00e1nicos HUANO&nbsp;<\/li><li><b>DPI&nbsp;<\/b><\/li><li>800\/1200\/1600\/3200<\/li><li><b>BOTONES<\/b><\/li><li>6<\/li><li><b>DISE\u00d1O<\/b><\/li><li>Ergon\u00f3mico<\/li><li><b>COMPATIBLE<\/b><\/li><li>Windows, Linux, Mac, PS4, PS5, XBOXONE, XBOX SERIES X-S<\/li><li><b>CABLE<\/b><\/li><li>1.6m<\/li><li><b>CORRIENTE<\/b><\/li><li>16.5mA&nbsp;<\/li><li><b>VOLTAJE<\/b><\/li><li>DC 5V&nbsp;<\/li><li><b>DIMENSIONES<\/b><\/li><li>116x62x38mm<\/li><\/ul><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"ANIMA","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.12,"unit_price":8.18,"unit_price_tax":8.18,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Ratones","sub_category":"Ratones","quantity":5,"brand":"ANIMA","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_tac-mou%20amg_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":3.18}}},"8713439204261":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["8713439204261",false],"wholesale_price":[6.97,false],"price":[11.97,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0.23",false],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combin